# Exclude files from EAS Build uploads.
# IMPORTANT: when this file exists, EAS uses it INSTEAD of .gitignore — so
# anything .gitignore was excluding (notably the native dirs) must be repeated
# here or it gets uploaded. Without the ios/ + dist/ lines below, the upload
# ballooned to ~540 MB (apps/mobile/ios = 940 MB of Pods/DerivedData) and
# stalled every build for ~10 min. EAS regenerates native dirs via prebuild,
# so they never need uploading.
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
docs/
AGENT_MEMORY.md
scripts/
*.log

# Native build dirs (gitignored but NOT auto-excluded once .easignore exists)
apps/mobile/ios/
apps/mobile/android/
ios/
android/

# OTA export output + caches
apps/mobile/dist/
dist/
**/.expo/
.DS_Store
